      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹45.41 (down from ₹46.07 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹6.42b (up 16% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹492.6m (down 1.3% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.7% (down from 9.0% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 9% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 5% per year.",
